---
// Privacy and data-processing policy. Written to cover what Colombian law (Ley 1581 de 2012,
// Decreto 1377 de 2013, art. 13) asks a policy to state. Update UPDATED when anything here changes.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../site';
import { breadcrumb } from '../lib/schema';

const UPDATED = new Date('2026-10-21');
const updated = UPDATED.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric', timeZone: 'UTC' });
const mail = `mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`;
---

<Base title="Privacy | Silent Thread" description="What silentthreadstudio.com collects, why, your rights, and how to have your data removed." schema={[breadcrumb([{ name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy' }])]}>
  <section class="section privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="label">Privacy</p>
      <h1 id="privacy-title" class="h2">Privacy.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Short version: no ads, no analytics, no tracking cookies. If you give us your email, we use it to send studio news and nothing else, and you can have it deleted at any time.</p>

      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>Silent Thread, run by Esteban Estrada, Medellín, Colombia. Email: <a href={mail}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Every request about your data goes to that address.</p>

      <h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Newsletter.</strong> Your email address, only if you subscribe. Used to send news about Silent Thread and its games. Never sold, never shared for anyone else's marketing.</li>
        <li><strong>Email you send us.</strong> Kept in our inbox so we can reply. Not added to the newsletter.</li>
        <li><strong>Your browser.</strong> The site saves two settings in your browser's local storage: your light or dark mode choice, and whether you have already seen the opening animation. They never leave your device.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Consent</h2>
      <p>Subscribing is your authorization to process your email address as described here. Kit then sends a confirmation email; nothing else arrives until you click it.</p>

      <h2>Who handles it for us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://kit.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Kit</a> stores the subscriber list and sends the newsletter.</li>
        <li><a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-notice" rel="noopener">Vercel</a> hosts the site and keeps standard server logs, such as IP address and browser, to run and protect it.</li>
        <li>Email to us is received and stored by Google (Gmail), forwarded by ImprovMX.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These providers store data outside Colombia, mainly in the United States. By subscribing or writing to us, you authorize that transfer.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Your email stays on the newsletter list until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete it. Then it is removed.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can, free of charge:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>know what data we hold about you, and update or correct it;</li>
        <li>ask for proof of your authorization, and how your data has been used;</li>
        <li>withdraw your authorization and ask us to delete your data;</li>
        <li>complain to Colombia's data-protection authority, the <a href="https://www.sic.gov.co" rel="noopener">Superintendencia de Industria y Comercio</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to use them</h2>
      <p>Write to <a href={mail}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> from the address concerned and say what you want. To leave the newsletter, the unsubscribe link at the bottom of every email works instantly. We answer questions within 10 business days, and requests to correct or delete within 15 business days.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes in a way that matters, subscribers hear about it by email before it applies.</p>

      <p class="updated">In effect since <time datetime={UPDATED.toISOString().slice(0, 10)}>{updated}</time>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy { padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 12vh); border-top: 0; min-height: 70svh; }
  .privacy .prose { max-width: 42rem; }
  .privacy h2 { margin: 2.2em 0 0.6em; font: 700 0.78rem var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-2); }
  .privacy ul { margin: 0 0 1em; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  .privacy li { margin: 0 0 0.5em; }
  .privacy li::marker { color: var(--fg-3); }
  .privacy a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline 1px var(--fg-3); text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .privacy a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--signal); }
  .updated { margin-top: 2.4em; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--fg-3); }
</style>
